{"v":1,"id":"33684dfc90f5","synced":false,"offset":null,"source":"whisper","lines":[{"t":"I walk these halls at midnight, where joy and laughter die","s":12.36,"e":19.44},{"t":"Your perfume lingers on my pillow, but you're not by my side","s":19.44,"e":26.1},{"t":"You dressed yourself in finest lace","s":26.1,"e":30.24},{"t":"Then chased another dream","s":30.24,"e":32.52},{"t":"Forgotten vows upon the floor","s":33.84,"e":36.84},{"t":"Swept out on restless streams","s":36.84,"e":39.58},{"t":"Still I keep the candle burning","s":40.14,"e":43.64},{"t":"Gentle in the window","s":43.64,"e":46.38},{"t":"Just in case you find your way","s":46.38,"e":50.22},{"t":"Swallowed by the shadow","s":50.22,"e":52.78},{"t":"Oh, why did you run?","s":52.78,"e":59.54},{"t":"Why did you turn?","s":61.4,"e":63.3},{"t":"My arms wide open","s":64.66,"e":67.34},{"t":"Yet here I burn","s":67.34,"e":69.94},{"t":"You played the bride","s":70.62,"e":72.74},{"t":"But left me alone","s":73.56,"e":75.92},{"t":"This house still whispers","s":77.32,"e":80.56},{"t":"My heart's your home","s":83.92,"e":87.14},{"t":"You're distant down the avenues","s":91.24,"e":94.88},{"t":"Where strangers call your name","s":94.88,"e":97.8},{"t":"Painted smiles and empty bits","s":97.8,"e":101.7},{"t":"My darling, not the same","s":101.7,"e":104.18},{"t":"Every room remembers dances","s":104.18,"e":108.74},{"t":"This is where you wore my ring","s":108.74,"e":111.16},{"t":"Every echo's just your laughter","s":111.16,"e":115.44},{"t":"On a winter wind","s":115.44,"e":117.72},{"t":"You built your home on shifting sand","s":118.28,"e":121.84},{"t":"Far from our embrace","s":121.84,"e":124.72},{"t":"Dressed in pride and masquerade","s":124.72,"e":128.62},{"t":"You vanished with no trace","s":128.62,"e":131.64},{"t":"Oh, why did you run?","s":135.78,"e":137.76},{"t":"Why did you turn my arms wide open, yet here I burn?","s":138.74,"e":148.3},{"t":"You played the bride, but left me alone.","s":149.66,"e":154.42},{"t":"This house still whispers, my heart's your home.","s":156.34,"e":165.62},{"t":"Did you tire of love's old songs","s":165.62,"e":169.54},{"t":"Did my promises go cold","s":170.12,"e":172.78},{"t":"Are you feasting in strange houses","s":172.78,"e":176.46},{"t":"While our story grows old","s":176.46,"e":179.74},{"t":"I've watched you wander far away","s":179.74,"e":183.36},{"t":"Your heart refused my own","s":183.36,"e":186.38},{"t":"I'm left here with the silence","s":186.38,"e":189.52},{"t":"But still I won't let go","s":189.52,"e":193.22},{"t":"Blood and tears pour down these walls","s":197.9,"e":202.08},{"t":"My sorrow won't let me sleep","s":202.08,"e":204.66},{"t":"I count each tear that falls for you","s":204.66,"e":208.58},{"t":"Every promise you didn't keep","s":208.58,"e":211.02},{"t":"Were my hands too gentle?","s":216.72,"e":219.6},{"t":"Was your hunger too wide?","s":220.36,"e":222.86},{"t":"Did you think there's greener fields beyond my riverside?","s":223.22,"e":229.28},{"t":"My vows remain unbroken, carved upon my soul.","s":229.64,"e":236.0},{"t":"I'll bear each bruise, each memory until you're whole.","s":237.22,"e":245.08},{"t":"Oh, why did you run?","s":249.58,"e":251.38},{"t":"Why did you turn my arms wide open","s":251.38,"e":259.02},{"t":"Yet here I burn","s":259.02,"e":261.58},{"t":"You played the bride but left me alone","s":262.32,"e":267.58},{"t":"This house still whispers","s":268.98,"e":272.24},{"t":"My heart's your home","s":275.22,"e":278.8},{"t":"So if you pass this way again","s":282.18,"e":285.96},{"t":"Don't be afraid to knock","s":286.46,"e":289.42},{"t":"The doors unlock, the candles lit","s":289.42,"e":293.52},{"t":"I'm still holding on","s":295.22,"e":298.58},{"t":"Thank you.","s":309.92,"e":310.1}],"match":null}
